description:
Design a circuit that takes a 32-bit input signal and performs two main operations. First, it increments the lower 16 bits of the input signal by one. Second, it concatenates the upper 16 bits of the input signal with the incremented lower 16 bits. The final 16-bit output signal consists of the lower bits of this concatenated result, effectively providing a modified version of the original data where the lower portion has been incremented.
module top_module(
    input clk,
    input [31:0] input_signal,
    output [15:0] output_signal
);

