description:
Design a 2-to-16 line decoder that takes two binary inputs, A and B, and generates a 16-bit output Y, where each bit of the output corresponds to a unique combination of the inputs. The outputs represent the active low signals for each of the 16 possible combinations of the input values, enabling selection of one of the 16 outputs based on the values of A and B.
module top_module(
    input A, B,
    output [15:0] Y
);

