description:
Design a bidirectional pad interface that controls data flow between an external signal and an internal circuit. The module leverages three control signals: `oe` (output enable) to drive `dout` onto the `pad` when active, and `ie` (input enable) to read the signal from `pad` into `din` when asserted, defaulting to LOW if `ie` is inactive. Thus, it effectively functions as a configurable input/output pad.
module top_module(

   din,

   pad,

   dout, oe, ie
   );

